// The hub corpus: every route of backend/parity/routes.python.json with valid input, invalid input (422/404/400) and
// auth failures, plus the stateful scenarios of the Python API tests (create -> commit -> plan -> apply -> verify ->
// rollback -> revert, inbox, import/observe, evaluations, knowledge proxy). Cases run IN ORDER on each side.
//
// Case fields: id, m (method), p (path; ${var} templates), q (query object), body (JSON) | raw (string body),
// ctype, as: admin|viewer|client|none|bad (default admin), csrf (default true for non-GET), host (Host header
// override), origin, headers (extra), save: {var: 'json.path' | '@header:name'}, snap: true (snapshot files after),
// text: true (compare the body as text; metrics normalised by N6).
// Normalisation rules: lib/normalize.mjs RULES (N1..N7).

